p03011.statement:
The causal classes: the null cone <span class="math">$\{Q_{
u}=0\}$</span> (<span class="math">$\p^{3}-\p^{2}+\p$</span> points) and the two classes of non-null vectors by the square class of <span class="math">$Q_{
u}(v)$</span>, <span class="math">$(\p-1)(\p^{3}+\p)/2$</span> each, partition <span class="math">$\Fp^{4}$</span> and are invariant under <span class="math">$O(Q_{
u},\Fp)$</span> and under rescaling: the shell’s null, timelike and spacelike separation (<span class="math">$\p=5$</span>, <span class="math">$13$</span> exhaustive).

p03016.statement:
The family <span class="math">$\Lambda(u)$</span>, <span class="math">$u=\g^{\Delta m}\in\Fpx$</span>: <span class="math">$\gamma=(u+u^{-1})/2\in\Fp$</span> but <span class="math">$a=(u-u^{-1})/(2c)\in c\Fp$</span>, outside <span class="math">$\Fp$</span> for <span class="math">$u
eq\pm1$</span>; it preserves <span class="math">$Q_{
u}$</span> over <span class="math">$K$</span>, where <span class="math">$Q_{
u}$</span> is Euclidean; the <span class="math">$\p-1$</span> matrices form the split torus of <span class="math">$SO(Q_{
u},K)$</span> — the extension’s rotations, not the shell’s boosts (<span class="math">$13$</span>, <span class="math">$17$</span> exhaustive).
